Changes from pstack:

- Renamed poteto to onyo everywhere: poteto-mode -> onyo-mode, poteto-help -> onyo-help,
  poteto-agent -> onyo-agent, docs/guide/02-poteto-mode.md -> 02-onyo-mode.md, and every
  cross-reference, frontmatter field, and line of prose that used the name.
- Renamed pstack to ostack: setup-pstack -> setup-ostack, pstack-models.mdc -> ostack-models.mdc (now ostack-models.md),
  and prose.
- Set the frontmatter name of onyo-mode and make-bot-ui to their folder names so every
  harness resolves them the same way.
- Added the claude-bridge skill.
- Added packaging for Claude Code (.claude-plugin), Codex (.codex-plugin, .agents/plugins),
  and skills.sh (skills.sh.json), and replaced the Cursor manifest with ostack's own.
- Rewrote the top of README.md and the install steps for a repository that isn't in the
  Cursor Marketplace.
- Ported the Cursor-specific parts to Claude Code. The Task tool and its parameters became the
  Agent tool, Cursor model slugs became a model and an effort per role, ostack-models.mdc became
  ~/.claude/rules/ostack-models.md, Custom Modes became the onyo output style, Bugbot became
  Claude Code Review, cursor-team-kit and Cursor built-ins became Claude Code built-ins, cloud
  agents became cloud sessions, Cursor Automations became Claude Code routines, and the Origin
  forge branches were removed. Added the onyo-reader agent for read-only roles.

The logo in assets/logo.png comes from pstack.

